<title>MAURITIUS: Mauritius rupee weaker on dollar, stable on pound.</title>
<headline>Mauritius rupee weaker on dollar, stable on pound.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritian rupee weakened against the dollar but was unchanged versus the pound on Tuesday, commercial banks forex dealers said.</p>
<p>The rupee was fixed at a mean commercial rate of 20.6275 for one dollar from 20.6245 on Monday. Against the pound, the rupee was unchanged on Tuesday, at a mean of 32.6175.</p>
</text>
